sections.wikitext:
A version by British trio Partyboys reached No. 44 on the [[UK Singles Chart]] in 2003.<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.officialcharts.com/search/singles/build-me-up-buttercup-2003/|title=Build Me Up Buttercup 2003 &#124; full Official Chart History &#124; Official Charts Company|website=[[Official Charts]]}}</ref>

[[David Johansen]] recorded a live version of the song on his concert album ''[[Live It Up (David Johansen album)|Live It Up]]''.  The album was recorded over two nights on February 4 and 5, 1982, at the Paradise Theatre (now known as the [[Paradise Rock Club]]) in Boston, Massachusetts.{{citation needed|date=June 2026}}

A version by [[Pop-punk]] band 'The Goops' appears in the 1995 film [[Mallrats]]<ref>{{Cite web |last=Maider |first=Ted |date=2010-08-25 |title=Cinema Sounds: Mallrats |url=https://consequence.net/2010/08/cinema-sounds-mallrats-mr/ |access-date=2026-08-19 |language=en-US}}</ref>

